      "type": "model",
      "message": {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "Let me work through the mathematics.\n\n**Determining f(x,y):**\n- f''_yy = 4 ⟹ f'_y = 4y + g(x)\n- f'_y(x,0) = √2 x ⟹ g(x) = √2 x, so f'_y = 4y + √2 x\n- f = 2y² + √2 xy + h(x)\n- f(x,0) = h(x) = x², so **f(x,y) = x² + √2 xy + 2y²**\n\n**On the ellipse x² + 2y² = 4:** parametrize x = 2cosθ, y = √2 sinθ.\n\nf = 4cos²θ + √2·(2cosθ)(√2 sinθ) + 2·2sin²θ = 4cos²θ + 4 sinθcosθ + 4sin²θ = 4 + 2sin2θ.\n\nSo max = 6, min = 2.",
        "tool_calls": [
          {
            "id": "call_e09553ed84214fbc98942ae8",
            "index": 0,
            "type": "function",
            "function": {
              "name": "submit_solution",
              "arguments": "{\"region_id\": \"region_art_0006_01\", \"final_answer\": \"f(x,y) = x² + √2·xy + 2y²；在约束 x² + 2y² = 4 下，最大值为 6，最小值为 2。\", \"reasoning\": \"第一步：由 f''_yy(x,y)=4 对 y 积分两次。f'_y(x,y)=4y+g(x)；再由 f'_y(x,0)=√2·x 得 g(x)=√2·x，故 f'_y=4y+√2·x。再对 y 积分：f(x,y)=2y²+√2·xy+h(x)。由 f(x,0)=x² 得 h(x)=x²，所以 f(x,y)=x²+√2·xy+2y²。\\n\\n第二步：在约束 x²+2y²=4（椭圆）上求极值。令 x=2cosθ，y=√2 sinθ（因 (2cosθ)²+2(√2 sinθ)²=4cos²θ+4sin²θ=4，满足约束）。代入：\\nf = (2cosθ)² + √2·(2cosθ)(√2 sinθ) + 2(√2 sinθ)²\\n= 4cos²θ + 4 sinθcosθ + 4sin²θ\\n= 4(cos²θ+sin²θ) + 2·(2 sinθcosθ)\\n= 4 + 2 sin2θ。\\n\\n第三步：因 sin2θ ∈ [−1,1]，故 f ∈ [4−2, 4+2] = [2, 6]。最大值 6（当 sin2θ=1，即 θ=π/4 等，对应点 (√2, 1) 等），最小值 2（当 sin2θ=−1，即 θ=−π/4 等，对应点 (√2, −1) 等）。\\n\\n（也可用拉格朗日乘数法验证：∇f=(2x+√2 y, √2 x+4y)=λ(2x,4y)，解得极值点处 f 取 2 与 6。）\"}"
